# BRING.list — what travels. The list is the authority; movepack never guesses.
#
# Lines are shell globs relative to the pack root (-r), '#' comments, and
# deny rules prefixed '!'. A deny hit PARKS the whole pack — never a silent
# skip, because a silent skip is how the wrong thing travels.
#
# Root for the Giza move: /f/claude   (pack:  movepack.sh pack -r /f/claude -o giza.tar.gz)
# Landing on Giza:        /c/claude   (unpack: movepack.sh unpack -r /c/claude giza.tar.gz)
#   Corwin's projects  ->  /c/claude/projects
#   the instrument's   ->  /c/claude/projects  (the /c/c/p root; see MOVE-NOTES.md)

# ---- deny rules first (they park; read them as the guard list) -------------
!*/SAVANNAH/*
!*SAVANNAH*
!*/svhck/*
!*/evidence/*
!*/.git/*
!*/.gnupg/*
!*id_rsa*
!*id_ed25519*
!*.key
!*secring*
!*/node_modules/*
!*.eclipse-increments/*

# ---- the instrument's materials --------------------------------------------
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/models
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/skills
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/journal
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/memory
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/book
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/CLAUDE.md
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/PLOT.md
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/PLOT-UTIL.md
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/model.md
AS4CE/AS4CE0001/MEMORY.md

# ---- projects (unredacted method + code; cases are denied above) ------------
projects/Avalon
projects/pmo
projects/lab
skills

# ---- the shelf and the standing views --------------------------------------
pub
corwin/PRINCIPLES.md
INTEL.md
SEMAPHORES.md

# ---- notes -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Savannah materials NEVER ride this pack — they mount as D: on Giza when the
# enclave is present, and travel by their own blessed path. The deny rules
# above are the tripwire, not the policy: policy is the keeper's (S15 — a
# guard is not a wall).
